{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n新生代演員曾展望（GM）與葉蒨文（Sophie）在最新一集《香港連場好戲》中，來到南區石澳向經典電影致敬。二人即場「星爺、柏芝上身」，重現《喜劇之王》的經典畫面，不單對白流利，連眼神都交足戲，場面既浪漫又搞笑！\n</p>\n<h2>石澳後灘即場上身 重現經典場面</h2>\n<p>節目中，曾展望與葉蒨文來到石澳巴士站與石澳後灘，這個地方立即令人聯想起周星馳與張柏芝在《喜劇之王》中的浪漫感情戲。二人被現場氣氛感染，決定即場還原這段經典，化身戲中的尹天仇和柳飄飄，深情對望，準備重演那段家喻戶曉的對話。</p>\n<h2>曾展望深情爆金句：「我養你呀！」</h2>\n<p>曾展望與葉蒨文隨即上演連場好戲，你一句我一句講出經典對白，由葉蒨文的「唔返得唔得？」、到「唔返工你養我呀？」，最後曾展望深情回應：「我養你呀！」。二人不單止對白熟練，連語氣、眼神都交足戲，演得非常投入，完美演繹出戲中的感動時刻。</p>\n<h2>葉蒨文交足戲 浪漫搞笑拿捏到位</h2>\n<p>這次的即興演出，充分展現了兩位年輕演員的功力。他們不僅僅是背誦對白，更是將電影裡那種既浪漫又帶點搞笑的複雜情感拿捏得恰到好處。葉蒨文的猶豫與倔強，配上曾展望的真誠與堅定，讓這段經典重現得相當有說服力，獲得現場工作人員一致讚賞。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版激讚：回憶返哂嚟！</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，網民對這段致敬演出反應熱烈，紛紛留言大讚：「呢一幕真係經典中嘅經典！」、「GM同Sophie做得好好喎，有feel！」、「《喜劇之王》睇幾多次都唔厭！」、「好想去石澳打卡呀！」、「兩個都好交到戲！回憶返哂嚟！」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_13441016066af7ebca0ee28.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_13441016066af7ebca0ee28.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5231596496af7ebd1b276d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5231596496af7ebd1b276d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_14265492596af7ebc2be6b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_14265492596af7ebc2be6b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_1371056506af7ebdf67a87.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_1371056506af7ebdf67a87.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_17919554166af7ebe5613f3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_17919554166af7ebe5613f3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_18769255376af7ebee14157.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_18769255376af7ebee14157.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T12:45:09.477553+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":901,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T12:11:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:22.046682+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T12:38:33.197849+00:00","content_hash":"99ec09a4c423b9ca51b397dc23c95d3ddd0a89743df6d84901195e985e80f75f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}